sections.body:
- Purchase price: {{price}}
- Other charges included: {{fees}}
- Down payment: {{down_payment}}
- Principal balance: {{balance}}
- Interest: {{rate}}% per year, simple interest on the unpaid balance
- Payments: {{number_payments}} monthly payments of {{payment}}, starting {{first_payment}}
- Prepayment: Buyer may prepay all or part at any time without penalty
- Late charge: no more than 5% of the late payment, and only if more than 15 days late, unless the law of {{state}} sets a lower limit

An amortization schedule is attached. Buyer: [[initial:buyer]]

Existing liens on the Property: {{liens}}

Pending government orders or code violations: {{public_orders}}

Seller will keep every existing lien current, will not place any new mortgage or lien on the Property, and will not let the total of liens exceed the balance Buyer owes. If Seller fails to pay an existing lien, Buyer may pay it directly and deduct the payment from what Buyer owes Seller. Seller will give Buyer copies of any default, foreclosure or tax notice within 5 days. Seller: [[initial:seller]]
